{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-18_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-18",
  "title": "血潮翻湧",
  "storyCode": "13-20",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-18_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5783ccadbe05477d2a76e6c699e53433c0454538aebe36f6a5fb0f684a6339d5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我的印象沒錯的話，我在你那虛偽的“軍事委員會”裡，似乎也有個職務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你是不是已經很久沒有送戰報給我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你太久沒有出席軍事委員會的相關會議了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一直擁有相應的指揮權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“指揮權”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不需要指揮我的子嗣們，他們天生就歸於我，歸於他們侍奉的王庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，你需要更好地看管他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戰爭的終局已經臨近，你的部屬需要發揮更重要的作用，他們的肆意妄為讓我厭煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "西線戰場花費了太多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是儀式的需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果沒有足夠的血與淚，我們又怎麼能累積這麼多的巫術材料呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和特蕾西婭向我聲稱，你們找到了那一扇遍結瘡痂的、古老的門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲苦難的源頭，命運的起點，真的就在那扇門之後嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "儀式的準備已經完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但其中的一個節點，那座叫布倫特伍德的鎮子，正在被我們的敵人進攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是在指派我為你解決這些小麻煩嗎，特雷西斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，您倒是提醒我了，軍事委員會德高望重的“攝政王”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然軍事委員會記得那麼一個“關鍵”的城鎮，為何並無像樣的布防？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "裹纏屍布的術師，骨肉傀儡，或是隨便什麼巫術加持、揮舞皮肉的莽漢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我縱容你和你的妹妹，因你們的靈魂強大耀眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "軟弱的薩卡茲會稱呼你為攝政王，赦罪師們簇擁在你的身邊，還為你帶回了特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "攝政王，死而復歸的“魔王”，你們是一對有趣的兄妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但，這都是因為，你們的舉止、力量，而不是你的……“地位”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“力量”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了降下最宏偉的詛咒，我已在這片戰場上布下賜福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作為最古老的王庭之一，我仁慈地喚起薩卡茲們血脈中本就潛藏的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，特雷西斯，你感受到了嗎？你為我的恩賜而喜悅嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你那駁雜的血液中，又能被瀝起幾分力量呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "終局將近，讓你心浮氣躁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "藏好你的弱點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者說，你需要一些提醒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會為你完成儀式的最後一部分，高傲的攝政王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這不是為了你們兄妹那狹小的雄心壯志，你們總是盯著那座擁有卡茲戴爾虛名的移動城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那只算得上痛楚的長河中的又一個歇腳處罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭已經準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座碎片大廈也將發揮出維多利亞永遠也預想不到的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那具骸骨正在城外軍營下的樞紐中等待，你可以從那裡前往布倫特伍德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……令人興奮，不是嗎？特雷西斯，你總是這麼一張了無生氣的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經看見了。從地平線那頭騰起的黑色光芒，像是一堵黑曜石牆，終將堆砌真正的城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……呵。你笑我急躁，可沉默不正是你遮掩內心的最佳手段嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願我還來得及回來，目睹那番盛況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若你真的能找回那種足以重塑這片大地的偉力，薩卡茲最初接觸到的……“源石”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我會為你，把卡茲戴爾的名號，鋪滿我將觸及的每片土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔大君閣下，巨獸的漂航即將結束，我們很快就會抵達布倫特伍德附近的停靠站。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那座小鎮已經被維多利亞人攻陷，您的造物也正被他們清掃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……造物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些無智的蟲豸，不過是鮮血王庭的子裔們為晶石塗畫咒文時，無意間灑下的幾滴殘血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就讓維多利亞人去慶祝他們的“勝利”吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我誤會了，抱歉，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你叫厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是的，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的血液中摻雜了太多酒精，我原諒貪婪與享樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你的猶疑，讓人失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以為你洗去它們，“少校”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……感謝您的好意，血魔大君閣下，我自己……能處理。我……會盡力改正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉……厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竊取時間的厄爾蘇拉。家喻戶曉的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，“厄爾蘇拉”居然挽起了這具骸骨的韁繩，小小的風趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閣下，這只是個巧合。我在為自己起名時，從未料到會真的如英雄一般——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉是個懦夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他甚至無法直視這隻巨獸的雙眼，只敢躲藏在它激起的亂流中，搖醒幾個沉溺於幻象的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我派給了他這樣的任務，當然了，“拯救了很多人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，你終於認出我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔大君閣下，我們即將抵達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能會有一些幻覺——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必提醒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我與它曾打的交道，遠比你多得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）你們費盡心血地建起了這座灰白色的卡茲戴爾，薩卡茲再一次擁有了家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）可你們不曾為它的狹小憤怒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）異族的侵略讓提卡茲失去了故鄉。於是，你們開始退讓，你們把代表家園之物一次次縮小、歪曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）直到一片平原，直到一圈圍場，直到你們只敢用它來稱呼自己的城市，自己的村莊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）這是薩卡茲軟弱的起點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）而如今，我將在終點前回望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幻境結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這具骸骨已經游回了巢穴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……血魔大君閣下，我有責任提醒您，那支控制了布倫特伍德核心法陣的部隊仍在附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們對骸骨會留下航跡並非一無所知，我們的歸來恐怕已經暴露。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您的力量不容置疑，但那些敵人中，也許有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的敵人毀壞了儀式的節點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這具骸骨在戰場上投下的那些法陣，本就只是猩紅王庭的觸鬚末端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罷了，既然已達終末……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，就由我親自作為這場最古老的儀式的中心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“遠逐者”啊，戴冠的獵手，我們的第一位魔王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若您萬年前的魂靈仍宿於眾魂之中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若您仍然注視著我們，注視著您家園淪喪的後代……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若那些被一次次扭曲、塗抹的渺遠的傳說並非虛假——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請讓那搖籃中的苦難再度降臨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請讓我們……再度尋回提卡茲已失落的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……如我們所料，維多利亞人正在對這裡發動進攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會盡可能地為您爭取完成儀式的時間，血魔大君閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞人？呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯，你真是給我留了一個驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不，名叫厄爾蘇拉的姑娘，我們要面對的，可不是什麼“維多利亞人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的客人，確實配得上見證這一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另一位血脈純淨之人，尚且稚幼的喪鐘。"
