    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會加強自己與巨獸的聯繫，竭盡所能阻止他們抵達這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔大君閣下，請您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還沒有資格向我提出建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我真想看看——他們這次又會向我吐出什麼陳詞濫調，他們又能向我展示什麼絕望的瞬間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，“少校”，留在這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的這份可有可無的工作，已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“破滅”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還在玩弄這些可悲的文詞，虛假的咒言，女妖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼不去正視那些，真正屬於你的，真正積蓄在你血脈之中的權力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你所能唱響的輓歌，現在難道不是應該更動聽了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你卻緘默，你卻，“從不開口”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們到底在試圖與什麼連接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這絕不是任何一種存在於薩卡茲文獻記載中的儀式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正在被喚醒的，那是……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是……我看見的，是……一枚“種子”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們……你們在用萬年前的巫術叫醒它，用戰場上的法陣滋養它，用碎片大廈的風暴駕馭它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這絕不能被允許！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們會徹底毀了倫蒂尼姆！那裡會淪為僅餘源石的廢都！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不止如此……這樣的規模，這樣的力量……我甚至能看到……"
