    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……“復仇”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡特斯，你仍聲稱你是薩卡茲的魔王，可你的觀點卻又是這麼地充斥偏見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兩百年前，泰拉諸國的聯軍毀去過一次卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而現在，你覺得，我們將維多利亞的首都獻給痛苦與毀滅，只是為了還擊兩百年前他們對我們的征服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……又一次令人失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑王冠仍停留於你的頭頂，這確實是“魔王”做出的，又一件荒唐的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺死一個敵人與屠戮一個國家，葬送一座城市與抹去一種文化，這些都沒有區別，對於薩卡茲，這些都遠不足以稱得上反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們來到倫蒂尼姆這座異族的首都，也從來不是為了這種“還擊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“種子”？不錯的描述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看著那顆種子會帶來什麼樣的光景吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "偏狹的人是你，血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任何一種花言巧語，都無法改變你們所行之事的本質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說我“從不開口”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，你會聽見的，血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“縛結，重枷落於你的軀骸。”"
